suggested_action.summary:
Embed this pre-populated Schema.org FAQPage snippet in your HTML <head> to enable zero-shot answer extraction in Perplexity and ChatGPT Search:

```html
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What does Welcome to Python.org do?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "The official home of the Python Programming Language"
      }
    }
  ]
}
</script>
```
